System is asus p5b-vm with core2 duo E6700, 2GB ram, sata disk.
OS is fedora core 6 test3 with kernel-2.6.18-1.2747.fc6 smp recompiled
after applying patch at
http://www.fr.zoreil.com/people/francois/misc/20060920-2.6.18-r8169-test.patch
attached there are dmesg and lspic -vvx outputs.
At the moment the network card is only connected to dsl modem with
